    "title": "Man found shot at Wake County apartment, sheriff's office investigating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joseph Ochoa, WRAL multiplatform producer ,\n6 hours ago A man is in the hospital Wednesday night after he was shot at an apartment in Wake County. According to the Wake County Sheriff's Office, deputies were called to reports of shots fired around 8 p.m. in the 9100 block of Fayetteville Road near Raleigh. When deputies arrived, they could not find a victim and witnesses were unsure if a shooting happened. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
